<title>DENMARK: Denmark's Hansen logs 1995/96 profit rise.</title>
<headline>Denmark's Hansen logs 1995/96 profit rise.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to August 31</p>
<p>				 (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Net turnover		   2,199.6    vs   1.760.1</p>
<p> Pre-tax result		   251.2    vs     225.0</p>
<p> Net result			 162.8    vs     146.0</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (percent)     20    vs    20</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish medical and biological products group is Chr.Hansen's Laboritarium A/S. It said in a statement that it expected a 10 percent rise in sales and pre-tax profits in 1996/97. --Eva Elgaard Pedersen, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33-96</p>
</text>
